{"metadata":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"!=","kind":"identifier"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"roleHeading":"Operator","extendedModule":"Swift","externalID":"s:SQsE2neoiySbx_xtFZ::SYNTHESIZED::s:7IvorMXL7MXLNoteV12NoteheadTextV4ItemO","modules":[{"relatedModules":["Swift"],"name":"IvorMXL"}],"symbolKind":"op","title":"!=(_:_:)"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Inherited from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Equatable.!=(_:_:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"!="},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"lhs"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"rhs"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlnote\/noteheadtext-swift.struct\/item\/!=(_:_:)"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLNote\/NoteheadText-swift.struct\/Item\/!=(_:_:)"},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLNote","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLNote\/NoteheadText-swift.struct","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLNote\/NoteheadText-swift.struct\/Item"]]},"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLNote":{"title":"MXLNote","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLNote"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Notes are the most common type of MusicXML data. The MusicXML format distinguishes between elements used for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sound information and elements used for notation information (e.g., tie is used for sound, tied for notation)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Thus grace notes do not have a duration element. Cue notes have a duration element, as do forward elements,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"but no tie elements. Having these two types of information available can make interchange easier, as some"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"programs handle one type of information more readily than the other."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLNote","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLNote"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlnote"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLNote/NoteheadText-swift.struct/Item":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlnote\/noteheadtext-swift.struct\/item","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLNote\/NoteheadText-swift.struct\/Item","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Item"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"One of the alternatives for NoteheadText."}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Item"}],"title":"MXLNote.NoteheadText.Item"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLNote/NoteheadText-swift.struct":{"title":"MXLNote.NoteheadText","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"NoteheadText","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"NoteheadText","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLNote\/NoteheadText-swift.struct","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlnote\/noteheadtext-swift.struct","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The notehead-text type represents text that is displayed inside a notehead, as is done in some educational"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"music. It is not needed for the numbers used in tablature or jianpu notation. The presence of a TAB or jianpu"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"clefs is sufficient to indicate that numbers are used. The display-text and accidental-text elements allow"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"display of fully formatted text and accidentals."}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLNote/NoteheadText-swift.struct/Item/!=(_:_:)":{"abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlnote\/noteheadtext-swift.struct\/item\/!=(_:_:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"!="},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLNote\/NoteheadText-swift.struct\/Item\/!=(_:_:)","role":"symbol","title":"!=(_:_:)","type":"topic"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","title":"IvorMXL","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/Iv